{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030095642503-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030095642\"/><p>清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（30日）宣布，由於大浪關係，西貢區的清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:00:37.960177+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T01:56:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:03.208292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:58:27.327506+00:00","content_hash":"3404185723584f81810ceb81cd87a346f9a5f70a83fafa2751478ce23263bf67","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}